DESIGN (why the watch target is green while iOS/macOS are deferred)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The watchOS companion is intentionally KMP-`Shared`-FREE — exactly like the
WidgetKit widgets (P8-0001). It renders the same already-display-formatted cached
glance summaries the phone publishes (ADR-016 keeps SI->display conversion on the
phone; the watch performs NO unit conversion) and talks to the phone over
WatchConnectivity. Because it never links Shared.xcframework, the TeslaSyncWatch
scheme builds + tests fully against the real watchOS 26.5 SDK + simulator without
the Kotlin/Native toolchain.

